String
MTK platform：
(1)gParamPowerMode: Power saving mode, 0: off 2: on;
(2)MTK_WifiBand(CT48 is gWifiBandType): wifi band, 0: 2.4G/5G 1: 5G 2: 2.4G;
(3)RoamingRcpiHi: The roaming first time threshold, 110-set value/2 has a range of 60-90 (110-*/2 = 60 to 90);
(4)RoamingRCPIGoodValue: Roaming Threshold, 110-set value/2 ranges from 60 to 90 (110-*/2 = 60 to 90);
(5)RoamingRCPIPoorValue: Roaming Low Threshold, 110-set value/2 ranges from 60-90 (110-*/2 = 60 to 90);
(6)RoamingRCPIDelta0: Roaming value added, range 4-20;
(7)RoamingRCPIDelta1: Roaming value added 1, range 4-20;
Qualcomm Platform：
(1)QCOM_PowerSave: Power saving mode, just set QCOM_PowerSave to 0,1,2;
gEnableImps: Power saving mode when not connected, 0: on, 1: off;
gEnableBmps: Power saving mode under connection, 0: on, 1: off;
0：gEnableImps=0,gEnableBmps=0；
1：gEnableImps=1,gEnableBmps=0；
2：gEnableImps=1,gEnableBmps=1；
(2)gNeighborLookupThreshold: Roaming threshold, range 58-100;
(3)RoamRssiDiff: Roaming sensitivity, range 3-20;
(4)QCOM_WifiBand: wifi bands, 0: 2.4G/5G, 1: 2.4G, 2: 5G.Just set QCOM_WifiBand to 0,1,2;
BandCapability: wifi band, 0: 2.4G/5G 1: 2.4G 2: 5G;
gRoamIntraBand:: 0: roaming across bands, 1: roaming within bands.
0:BandCapability=0,gRoamIntraBand=0；
1:BandCapability=1,gRoamIntraBand=1；
2:BandCapability=2,gRoamIntraBand=1；
(5)gDot11Mode: Protocols supported by WIFI;
0: Automatic;
1：802.11a、b、g；
2：802.11b；
3：802.11g；
4：802.11n；
5：仅802.11g；
6：仅802.11n；
7：仅802.11b;
8：仅802.11ac；
9：802.11ac；
(6)gRoamPrefer5GHz: 5G priority mode switch, 0: off, 1: on;
(7)gSelect5GHzMargin: Compare how many db 2.4GHz outperforms 5GHz before roaming to 2.4GHz under 5g priority, range 0-100;
(8)gRrmEnable: 802.11k support Whether 11k is supported, 0: not supported, 1: supported;
(9)g11dSupportEnabled: 802.11d support Whether 11d is supported, 0: not supported, 1: supported;
(10)FastTransitionEnabled: FT mode (802.11r, fast roaming), 0: off, 1: on;
New Model RT40S:
(1)BT_WifiBand: wlan band
Automatic: auto
5GHz band only: a
2.4GHz band only: b
(2)BT_PowerSave: wlan power saving mode
Turn on power saving mode: 2
Turn off power saving mode: 0
(3)BT_RoamTrigger: Roaming Threshold
Range -50~-100
(4)BT_RoamDelta: Roaming value-added
Range 2~20
(5)BT_AssocPref: wlan roaming policy
Automatic: auto
Priority roaming 5GHz policy: a
